### skill.md  [instructions]
- Douyin's web search (`douyin.com/search/`) requires login in most cases. This skill uses a **two-strategy approach**:
- 1. **Primary: Browser search** — open the Douyin search page in the browser tool. Works if the user has logged into Douyin in the browser profile.
- 2. **Fallback: Web search** — use `web_search` with `site:douyin.com` to find Douyin videos, then fetch individual video pages for details.
- ### Strategy 1: Browser Search (preferred when logged in)
- Use the **browser** tool:
- url: https://www.douyin.com/search/搜索关键词
- url: https://www.douyin.com/search/%E6%B5%B7%E9%B2%9C%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91
- After the page loads:
- 1. Take a snapshot: `action: snapshot`
- 2. If you see a captcha/login wall, close the popup or switch to Strategy 2
- 3. If results are visible, extract video titles, authors, stats, and links
- 4. Return structured results
- ### Strategy 2: Web Search Fallback (always works)
- Use `web_search` to find Douyin videos:
- web_search: query="site:douyin.com 海鲜视频"
- Then for each result URL, use `web_fetch` to get the video page details.
- The web search results provide:
- - Video page URLs on douyin.com
- - Snippet descriptions from search engines
- ### Extracting Details from Video Pages
- For individual video pages (e.g., `https://www.douyin.com/video/7350xxxxx`), you can:
- 1. Use `web_fetch` on the URL — may return SSR data with video metadata
- 2. Use the browser tool to open the page and take a snapshot
- - **Login required**: Douyin's web search typically requires login. Without login, you'll see a captcha wall. The web search fallback works around this.
- - **API restrictions**: Douyin's search API requires msToken + X-Bogus signing, which is not available without a full browser session.
+ This skill uses a **two-strategy approach**:
+ 1. **Primary: Browser search via `so.douyin.com`** — works without login, returns full video results.
+ 2. **Fallback: Web search** — use `web_search` with Douyin-related queries when browser is unavailable.
+ ### Strategy 1: Browser Search (primary, works without login)
+ Use the **browser** tool to open `so.douyin.com`:
+ url: https://so.douyin.com/s?keyword=搜索关键词&search_entrance=aweme&pd=general
+ url: https://so.douyin.com/s?keyword=%E6%B5%B7%E9%B2%9C%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91&search_entrance=aweme&pd=general
+ After the page loads (wait ~5 seconds for JS rendering):
+ 1. Use `action: act, kind: evaluate` with `fn: async () => { await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 5000)); return document.body.innerText.substring(0, 5000); }` to extract text content
+ 2. Parse the results — each video entry typically contains:
+    - **Title/Description** — the video caption
+    - **Duration** — e.g. "02:03"
+    - **Stats** — likes, comments, shares, bookmarks (4 numbers per video)
+    - **Author** — creator name
+    - **Date** — e.g. "04月22日"
+ 3. Return structured results
+ **Important**: `www.douyin.com/search/` requires login and shows a captcha wall. Always use `so.douyin.com/s?keyword=` instead.
+ ### Strategy 2: Web Search Fallback
+ If the browser tool is unavailable, use `web_search`:
+ web_search: query="抖音 海鲜视频"
+ This returns news articles and related content about Douyin videos, but not direct video links.
+ - **Login wall on www.douyin.com**: The main domain (`www.douyin.com/search/`) requires login and shows a captcha. Always use `so.douyin.com/s?keyword=` instead, which works without login.
+ - **API restrictions**: Douyin's search API requires msToken + X-Bogus signing. Use the browser-based `so.douyin.com` approach instead.